{"unit_id":"sadkga__dsh-restart-handoff#card-zh","repo":"sadkga/dsh-restart-handoff","commit":"79e70a40fce7eb042bcd70fe22a9dc6cacf54ff5","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-restart-handoff 是面向 DeepSeek Harness 的会话重启插件，接入 DSH 工具和系统提示。它提供 restart_dsh 两步确认工具：先展示将恢复的会话与待续指令，再用确认令牌安排重启；新进程重放交接并恢复会话，也可唤醒子代理。启动时还会恢复符合条件的中断会话。适合需要重启宿主后继续代理工作的用户。需要由 Restart=always 管理的服务单元，并使用本地会话持久化目录；不需要额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:2090-2104","index.js:2330-2402","index.js:1805-1835"]}
{"unit_id":"sadkga__dsh-restart-handoff#card-en","repo":"sadkga/dsh-restart-handoff","commit":"79e70a40fce7eb042bcd70fe22a9dc6cacf54ff5","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-restart-handoff resumes DeepSeek Harness sessions after restart. Its restart_dsh tool previews the plan, then acts after token confirmation. The new process replays the handoff, resumes sessions and can wake subagents. Startup recovery also restores eligible interrupted sessions.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:2090-2104","index.js:2330-2402","index.js:1805-1835"]}
